# Origin of the Martin tile server, as reached from the browser.
#
# Martin belongs to the CIS stack, not this repo — see docs/vector-tiles.md.
# Leave unset to take the per-mode default from src/map/config/martin.ts:
#   dev   -> http://localhost:3001   (CIS publishes Martin on this host port)
#   build -> /tiles                  (same-origin, proxied by client/nginx.conf.template)
#
# Set it to point at a deployed stack, e.g.
# VITE_TILES_URL=https://cis.example.gov.ph/tiles
